D1_nz_eta_info.body:
New Zealand Immigration notice: Chinese citizens must obtain an NZeTA (New Zealand Electronic Travel Authority) and pay the
International Visitor Conservation and Tourism Levy (IVL). NZeTA fee: NZD 17 via mobile app / NZD 23 via website;
IVL: NZD 35. Processing can take up to 72 hours — apply at least 1 week ahead. Note: NZeTA is not a visa;
it is a separate travel authorization system.
